<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIA - CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JULY 3.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIA - CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JULY 3.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania on Wednesday</p>
<p>set the following currency fixings for July 3. The litas is</p>
<p>pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to one.</p>
<p>		   03.07.97	  02.07.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.6326	    6.6644</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.2913	    2.2913</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.5006	    4.5060</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.4925	    3.4777</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.5159	    0.5171</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7687	    0.7688</p>
<p>    EEK	  0.2866	    0.2865</p>
<p>    LAT	  6.9906	    6.9924</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6917	    0.6918</p>
<p>    PLN	  1.2188	    1.2159</p>
<p>-- Burton Frierson, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
